WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:07.400
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:13.533
Well, I'll say this. This is going
to change science-fiction forever.

00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:17.200
There's not going to be any more
"E.T." or "My Favorite Martian".

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.567
People won't understand.
E.T. won't be phoning home.

00:00:21.567 --> 00:00:23.200
He'll be waiting for you in a dark tunnel

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.867
ready to strangle you while
he literally eats you alive.

00:00:26.867 --> 00:00:29.467
If you're lucky, he'll snap your neck first.

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:32.000
People of the future will understand THAT.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.067
[humming E.T. theme song]

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:38.067
Okay, so what am I doing? I
guess shimmy along this wall,

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:41.167
though I don't much--WHAAAWHOA! WHOA-OO JAH!

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:43.600
Jesus CHRIST, that is slick!

00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:49.967
Slip 'N Slide, slip and die, everybody
slippin', havin' a good time...

00:00:49.967 --> 00:00:53.333
Now THERE'S a thought.
Yeah, that's a GOOD thought,

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:57.433
as long as I'm not standing on oil
that'll burn me alive if I ignite it.

00:00:58.167 --> 00:01:00.433
[straining]
Oh yeah, it's got some in there.

00:01:00.433 --> 00:01:02.133
[straining]
Okay, let's do this.

00:01:03.233 --> 00:01:05.533
Oh, there it goes. Okay.

00:01:05.533 --> 00:01:06.900
Oh, nice!

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:07.933
Dah!

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:08.433
Gyah!

00:01:08.433 --> 00:01:09.500
DAH!

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:13.667
OHHHH! Yeah, that's a tough
pill to swallow, huh?!

00:01:13.667 --> 00:01:18.033
Kill everything with barrels.
This is "Donkey Kong" warfare.

00:01:18.033 --> 00:01:21.067
Okay, slippin' time.

00:01:21.067 --> 00:01:22.267
Yeah...!

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:27.067
Oh wow, that's a strong smell.

00:01:27.067 --> 00:01:28.967
Bleh...

00:01:28.967 --> 00:01:34.367
Oh my god! Is the Earth even
worth saving? Are we too late?

00:01:34.367 --> 00:01:36.200
I mean, look at this!

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:38.667
What... HEY, THAT ONE'S TONGUE IS DOWN!

00:01:40.167 --> 00:01:42.700
I don't even understand
how these things got here.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:46.300
I thought they grew into the
ceiling but these are on open mesh.

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:47.467
Dammit, that's another one.

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:52.367
Fuck...

00:01:52.367 --> 00:01:54.367
So does that mean these things are mobile?

00:01:54.367 --> 00:01:55.100
Ah! Shit...!

00:01:56.967 --> 00:02:00.967
Well, I haven't seen them move, but...

00:02:00.967 --> 00:02:05.233
I don't really want to think about
that. I don't want to be here, really.

00:02:05.233 --> 00:02:07.567
Oh! What the hell?

00:02:08.433 --> 00:02:10.600
They must've heard my gunshots.

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:12.533
Still, they didn't even see me.

00:02:12.533 --> 00:02:16.767
They're just throwing it out there,
just in case? I don't see anyone.

00:02:16.767 --> 00:02:19.733
I mean, what are the odds
of me being exactly there?

00:02:19.733 --> 00:02:21.567
Maybe I'm looking at this the wrong way;

00:02:21.567 --> 00:02:23.500
it's just some guy sitting around saying,

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:26.433
"Oh, there's a fuel
barrel. Better blow it up."

00:02:26.433 --> 00:02:28.533
I still don't understand everything here.

00:02:31.033 --> 00:02:32.733
I guess--OH!

00:02:32.733 --> 00:02:33.733
[explosion]

00:02:33.733 --> 00:02:35.833
Do they know I'm here or are they just...

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:40.167
tossing these every thirty seconds?

00:02:40.167 --> 00:02:41.567
Fuck YOU!

00:02:41.567 --> 00:02:44.900
Shit. I guess Donkey Kong's
really not that far off.

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:46.000
[explosions]

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.767
Man, it's hard to shoot when I'm swimming.

00:02:48.767 --> 00:02:50.533
I keep wanting to paddle with this hand

00:02:50.533 --> 00:02:54.233
but I know my muscle memory will betray
me and I'll shoot myself in the knee.

00:02:54.233 --> 00:02:58.167
Or the head, why not? It just
depends on what stroke I'm doing.

00:02:58.167 --> 00:03:02.867
Okay! Suppressing fire! That's
today's show's secret phrase!

00:03:02.867 --> 00:03:04.567
OH NO! THAT'S EXACTLY WHAT--

00:03:04.567 --> 00:03:06.367
[underwater panicking]

00:03:06.367 --> 00:03:07.467
[muffled explosions]

00:03:09.433 --> 00:03:10.233
Barrels...

00:03:11.467 --> 00:03:13.867
I fell right into it! Right into it!

00:03:13.867 --> 00:03:15.967
C'mon! Run...RUN!

00:03:15.967 --> 00:03:18.267
I CAN'T AIM LIKE THIS! BACK OFF!

00:03:18.833 --> 00:03:20.367
Oh, you're fucked now.

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:22.600
See ya!

00:03:23.867 --> 00:03:25.800
Catch ya later!

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:28.067
Okay, is that all of them?

00:03:28.067 --> 00:03:29.500
Nope, nope! No...

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:34.300
Damn, that guy's far off.

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:37.433
God, this is such a
fish-in-a-barrel layout...

00:03:37.433 --> 00:03:37.933
[gunshots]

00:03:37.933 --> 00:03:42.433
Where'd that come from?! Was that an echo?

00:03:42.433 --> 00:03:45.000
[gunshots]
Nope, there he is. Jesus...

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.700
[inhale]

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:53.500
[exhale]

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:57.700
Yeah, accuracy doesn't matter so
much as hitting the person once.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:02.467
I mean, if you miss somebody
ten times but hit them once,

00:04:02.467 --> 00:04:05.333
who's going to say you did a bad job? Them?

00:04:05.333 --> 00:04:08.200
Another barrel. Why take a chance?

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:11.667
What?

00:04:12.767 --> 00:04:14.500
What's going on?

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:18.533
Was he already dead and
just lying there, or...?

00:04:18.533 --> 00:04:21.933
Was he trying to ride the
barrel off into space?

00:04:21.933 --> 00:04:24.400
Everything's so counterintuitive .

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:30.367
My whole career I've always tried
to figure out what's happening.

00:04:30.367 --> 00:04:32.467
That's why I was so good at my job.

00:04:32.467 --> 00:04:36.167
Well actually, there's a lot of reasons
I'm so good, but that's part of it.

00:04:36.167 --> 00:04:40.600
But these past few days I ask questions
and the answers don't make sense at all.

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:43.767
Yeah, like him, just sunbathing
here with his clothes on.

00:04:43.767 --> 00:04:46.367
An inquisitive mind is no good here.

00:04:46.367 --> 00:04:51.067
Now the more I learn, the more the
answers are either stupid or crazy.

00:04:51.067 --> 00:04:53.500
I'm not an elder god at all, am I?

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:56.400
I didn't get any of his powers. This sucks.

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:00.300
I mean, what am I doing here?

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.933
That Barney guy sent me this way, right?

00:05:02.933 --> 00:05:04.567
Is he trying to kill me?

00:05:04.567 --> 00:05:07.167
"Yeah, Gordon. Take the canals, right?

00:05:07.167 --> 00:05:11.000
"Then the police can shoot at you from
above while you're trying to swim,

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:14.833
"and can completely surround you without
getting caught in the crossfire."

00:05:16.067 --> 00:05:17.833
[growls]

00:05:17.833 --> 00:05:19.767
See, that's his brilliance.

00:05:19.767 --> 00:05:25.300
Even now, I don't know if he is just that
dumb or if I fell right into his trap.

00:05:27.933 --> 00:05:31.667
Incompetence can be really hard
to distinguish from malice.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:37.400
Okay...? No.

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:42.900
I dealt with this incompetence-or-malice
dilemma all the time back at Black Mesa,

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:46.467
but I feel like the stakes
have risen since then.

00:05:46.467 --> 00:05:49.033
It's not about
sabotaging my project anymore,

00:05:49.033 --> 00:05:51.433
[chopper sound]
it's about murdering my--shit.

00:05:51.433 --> 00:05:54.033
Yeah see, I get tired
of hearing explanations

00:05:54.033 --> 00:05:58.033
of whether people trying to
kill me is an accident or not.

00:05:58.033 --> 00:06:03.433
I'm thinking I should take him out
next time I see him just to be safe.

00:06:03.433 --> 00:06:06.533
But... No, I can't do that.

00:06:06.533 --> 00:06:08.900
Kleiner would never forgive
me for killing his assistant

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:11.433
without providing an adequate replacement.

00:06:11.433 --> 00:06:14.167
I guess I'll just have to keep my eyes open.

00:06:14.167 --> 00:06:17.533
So where's the--WHOA WHOA WHOA WHOA! Ugh.

00:06:17.533 --> 00:06:18.567
Too much oil...

00:06:18.567 --> 00:06:20.867
Oh, that's great. Yeah, take a photo, huh?

00:06:20.867 --> 00:06:23.867
[machine gun fire]
Oh my god. Shooting! Don't you understand?!

00:06:23.867 --> 00:06:27.500
BLAH! YOU DID IT AGAIN!

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:28.133
NO!

00:06:28.133 --> 00:06:31.067
[machine gun fire, clanging]
[screaming]

00:06:31.067 --> 00:06:33.233
Stop, stop, STOP IT, STOP!

00:06:33.233 --> 00:06:36.733
JUST BECAUSE I'VE BEEN SHOT BEFORE
DOESN'T MEAN I'M ANY BETTER AT IT NOW!

00:06:36.733 --> 00:06:38.633
[machine gun fire, clanging]
[screaming]

00:06:38.633 --> 00:06:41.800
Fuck this... fuck this...!
I don't have any cover!

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.300
Uh, think quick!

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:45.100
[machine gun fire]
OH OHH!

00:06:46.067 --> 00:06:51.067
Fuck Barney! This is the worst route!
THIS IS THE WORST ROUTE I COULD'VE TAKEN!

00:06:51.067 --> 00:06:51.833
WHOA!

00:06:52.967 --> 00:06:54.900
Yeah, I needed more problems!

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:56.167
Oh god, GOD!

00:06:56.167 --> 00:06:56.800
A DOOR!

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:58.100
FUCKING MOVE!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:00.700
[machine gun fire, clanging]
[crying]

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:02.300
Don't be locked, Christ!

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:04.067
Finally! Got one!

00:07:04.067 --> 00:07:06.467
Oh! Ohhhhh...

00:07:06.467 --> 00:07:09.033
YEAH, COME FLY IN THE DOORWAY, ASSHOLE!

00:07:09.033 --> 00:07:12.233
Ohhh...

00:07:12.233 --> 00:07:14.733
Yeah, underground's good.

00:07:14.733 --> 00:07:16.167
What is...?

00:07:16.167 --> 00:07:17.233
Fuck you.

00:07:17.233 --> 00:07:19.600
You're dead. I'm not listening to you.

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.433
I'm robbing you.

00:07:21.433 --> 00:07:24.233
Yeah, I guess I need more of these, huh?

00:07:24.233 --> 00:07:27.000
Well, as shitty damp dead-ends go,

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:30.600
I'm more appreciative of this
one than I have been in a while.

00:07:32.233 --> 00:07:34.733
Y'know, the last time I tried
to live underground forever,

00:07:34.733 --> 00:07:38.933
it didn't work out because I got
hungry, but maybe this time's different.

00:07:38.933 --> 00:07:41.900
Actually I don't remember what
happened. It was nothing good.

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:46.733
Yeah, you know all about "nothing
good", huh? Fuck! He was torched.

00:07:46.733 --> 00:07:48.133
What's here?

00:07:48.133 --> 00:07:50.733
Oh, that's nice. Looks
like a body back there.

00:07:50.733 --> 00:07:52.800
Yeah, that's just what I'm looking for.

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:54.467
Wait, no. I'm not.

00:07:54.467 --> 00:07:56.633
This water's contaminated.

00:07:56.633 --> 00:07:59.833
Do the Tripods not need water or something?

00:07:59.833 --> 00:08:01.367
Are they robots?

00:08:01.367 --> 00:08:04.200
That would be a curve ball, wouldn't it?

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:05.800
I suppose I could--WHUP!

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:10.733
[choking]

00:08:10.733 --> 00:08:14.567
[wheezing]

00:08:14.567 --> 00:08:17.733
[coughing]

00:08:17.733 --> 00:08:22.167
[vomiting]

00:08:22.167 --> 00:08:23.500
Fuck that...

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:25.733
[groaning]

00:08:25.733 --> 00:08:26.967
I have to kill it...

00:08:26.967 --> 00:08:28.600
...kill it before it's too late...

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:30.667
...kill...

00:08:31.167 --> 00:08:32.333
...keep killing...

00:08:33.967 --> 00:08:35.700
Oh my god...

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.267
Okay, I have to go easy...

00:08:38.267 --> 00:08:39.733
Easy...

00:08:39.733 --> 00:08:42.033
Easy fucking does it!

00:08:42.033 --> 00:08:43.600
EASY!

00:08:44.767 --> 00:08:46.700
Well that's not happening again.

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:48.367
[machine gun fire]
What the hell?!

00:08:48.367 --> 00:08:50.900
Oh, he probably saw my flashlight.

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:53.733
I'm surprised. It's broad daylight.

00:08:53.733 --> 00:08:55.533
[machine gun fire]
Yeah, just keep shooting that spot.

00:08:55.533 --> 00:08:57.533
That's good. That's good.

00:08:57.533 --> 00:09:04.233
Oh, that was traumatic! Even amongst
the blur of trauma my life has become.

00:09:04.233 --> 00:09:08.267
Honest to--OH HO HO HO HO! No, no.

00:09:08.267 --> 00:09:11.533
Fool me once, you almost fucking kill me.

00:09:11.533 --> 00:09:14.000
[straining]
Fool me twice, no.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:15.700
[straining]
Okay, come on.

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:19.633
You will be my emissary. I trust
you to communicate on my behalf.

00:09:20.333 --> 00:09:24.733
Damn, a little LOUD, but that's
what I would've said, too.

00:09:24.733 --> 00:09:26.700
Christ, they're eating the scraps.

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:30.400
Here, have everything,
you fucking hell-goats.

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:33.067
If I wasn't bitter, this
could be entertaining.

00:09:33.067 --> 00:09:33.900
Ugh.

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:37.967
Okay, I'm going to slide down
here and shoot up like a bad ass.

00:09:37.967 --> 00:09:39.000
Uhh...

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:42.767
Damn, I guess this ramp's not as slick.

00:09:42.767 --> 00:09:46.033
Okay, I'm getting out of here
before I get choked twice.

00:09:46.033 --> 00:09:48.200
Not again, NOT AGAIN!

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:52.800
I am legit traumatized. I don't
even want to eat spaghetti anymore.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:54.500
[machine gun fire]

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:57.467
Okay, it sounds like he's
still aiming at that one spot,

00:09:57.467 --> 00:09:58.333
so--Nope.

00:10:00.533 --> 00:10:03.000
[machine gun fire]

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:05.167
Y'know, I'm really not
happy with how many times

00:10:05.167 --> 00:10:07.933
I'm finding myself saying,
"It could be worse."

00:10:10.567 --> 00:10:13.133
I mean, yeah, I could be dead. That's worse.

00:10:13.133 --> 00:10:17.133
That's a nice low bar for
us to judge things by. Fuck.

